  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside the battlefield killer move grey cloud battle puppet he is the dual spear wielding rank seven Gu Immortal who makes Fang Yuan struggle in close combat. Ice spears form in his hands, he pierces Fang Yuan’s left arm and stomach, and fragmentary ice and snow path dao marks make the wounds hard to heal.",
      "chapters": [
        1141
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Snowmen have snow-white skin, ice blue pupils, and aqua blue hair. Bing Zhuo is robust and strong, his upper body bare, with a dark blue tattoo on his chest. His aqua blue hair is tied up, revealing a firm and dauntless face.",
      "chapters": [
        1143
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_snowmen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the underground banquet he brings ice wolf wine he brewed himself in an ice wine bowl that releases cold air. The wine is icy in the mouth and hot like fire in the throat. Xue Er introduces him as Brother Bing Zhuo, the strongest in their tribe, normally cold and extremely prideful, and passionate only when talking with Elder Fang Yuan. Fang Yuan recognizes him as the dual spear fighter from dozens of rounds earlier; Bing Zhuo laughs and gives a thumbs up. He praises Fang Yuan’s upper extreme heavenly eagle and drinks with him.",
      "chapters": [
        1143
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-wolf-wine-and-tribe-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xue_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the feast he still wants to chop Fang Yuan into pieces for how the ice tear scene embarrassed Xue Er, yet he only asks for a future spar.",
      "chapters": [
        1147
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-wolf-wine-and-tribe-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A mortal Gu Fang Yuan holds in those days comes from Bing Zhuo, and Bing Zhuo also sends letters among the variant human correspondence of that period.",
      "chapters": [
        1149
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-wolf-wine-and-tribe-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After returning from a rockman dispute he says angrily that the rockmen distort facts because they have immemorial rock dragon rank eight battle strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1459
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "moli-region-dispute",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before another battle he is named a rank seven close combat Gu Immortal who regrets that he cannot fight in that outing.",
      "chapters": [
        1545
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "moli-region-dispute",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan traps snowman and rockman Gu Immortals in an immortal battlefield, Bing Zhuo is the sole rank seven among them and asks Fang Yuan to open the field so they can contact their tribe. Fang Yuan steals his Immortal Gu with great thief ghost hand, then claims Bing Zhuo is a Heavenly Court Gu Immortal in disguise and that the real Bing Zhuo died long ago, using the untriggered alliance agreement as cover. Bing Zhuo forms ice spears, charges, and fights yama children as a close combat specialist. Fang Yuan makes a yama child self-detonate with Soul Explosion; Bing Zhuo cannot dodge at that range, and the explosion destroys his corpse entirely.",
      "chapters": [
        1584
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-yama-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "move_soul_explosion"
      ]
    }
  ],
